      "questionCode": "q.db.fd.closure-basic",
      "title": "求属性 A 的闭包",
      "content": "关系模式 R(A,B,C,D)，函数依赖集 F = {A→B, B→C}。属性 A 的闭包 A+ 是？（单选）",
      "type": "SINGLE",
      "options": [
        { "key": "A", "value": "{A,B}" },
        { "key": "B", "value": "{A,B,C}" },
        { "key": "C", "value": "{A,B,C,D}" },
        { "key": "D", "value": "{A,B,D}" }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "analysis": "初值 A；由 A→B 得 {A,B}；由 B→C 得 {A,B,C}；没有依赖可再扩展，因此 A+ = {A,B,C}。D 不能由 A 推出。",
      "misconception": "closure.one-step：只应用一次函数依赖就停止，忽略传递扩展。",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "sectionCode": "sec.db.fd",
