      "questionCode": "q.db.fd.closure-composite",
      "title": "复合决定因素的闭包",
      "content": "关系模式 R(A,B,C,D,E)，F = {AB→C, C→D, D→E}。属性集 AB 的闭包 (AB)+ 是？（单选）",
      "type": "SINGLE",
      "options": [
        { "key": "A", "value": "{A,B,C}" },
        { "key": "B", "value": "{A,B,C,D}" },
        { "key": "C", "value": "{A,B,C,D,E}" },
        { "key": "D", "value": "{A,B,E}" }
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "analysis": "初值 {A,B}；AB→C 可用，得 {A,B,C}；C→D 可用，得 {A,B,C,D}；D→E 可用，得 {A,B,C,D,E}。因此 (AB)+ 包含全部属性。",
      "misconception": "closure.ignore-composite：忽略复合决定因素，或扩展后不继续使用新属性。",
      "difficulty": 3,
