      "questionCode": "q.db.fd.superkey-not-candidate",
      "title": "超键但不是候选键",
      "content": "关系模式 R(A,B,C)，F = {A→B, B→C}。下列哪个集合是超键但不是候选键？（单选）",
      "type": "SINGLE",
      "options": [
        { "key": "A", "value": "{A}" },
        { "key": "B", "value": "{A,B}" },
        { "key": "C", "value": "{B}" },
        { "key": "D", "value": "{C}" }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "analysis": "A+ = {A,B,C}，A 是最小超键；{A,B}+ = {A,B,C} 是超键，但包含更小的候选键 A，因此不是候选键。B+ = {B,C} 与 C+ = {C} 都不是超键。",
      "misconception": "candidate.not-minimal / superkey.candidate-same：把非最小超键当成候选键。",
